# Installing a variant into this repo to dogfood it copies the skill under .claude/.
# Committing that would put a second, silently diverging copy of the skill in the repo,
# where skills/ is the source of truth. Consumers of the skill may well want to commit
# their own .claude/ — this rule is for this repository only.
.claude/
